#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:32
msgid ""
"You should configure email for notifications to be notified about router "
"events"
msgstr ""
"Aby ste boli informovaní o prevádzke routera, mali by ste nastaviť e-mail"
" pre notifikácie"

#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:35
msgid ""
"Turris system contains notification system. Various components, including"
" healthcheck, are using it to inform administrator about possible issues."
msgstr ""
"Súčasťou systému Turris je systém notifikácií. Rôzne komponenty, vrátane "
"kontroly stavu, ho využívajú na informovanie administrátora o možných "
"problémoch."

#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:41
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In reForis navigate to Maintenance setting and configure email "
"notifications there."
msgstr ""
"V rozhraní Foris prejdite do nastavení údržby a nastavte tam e-mailové "
"oznámenia."

#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:51
